7,Music | Daraa Tribes,https://www.daraatribes.com/,"DARAA TRIBES BIO A fusion of ancestral tribal music and Saharan Blues, Daraa Tribes comes from the oasis town of Tagounite in the Daraa River Valley of Morocco, with each member originating from a different tribe, bringing with them diverse music traditions to create an eclectic style only to be found in the oases of the North African Sahara.",Daatsʼíin,Nilo-Saharan
